    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "AVAILABLE FOR  VIEWING ON WEDNESDAY THE 30TH SEPTEMBER AT 6.30PM | PLEASE CONFIRM IF YOU WOULD LIKE TO ATTEND\r\n\r\nLambay Properties Estate Agents are delighted to present this beautifully maintained, modern ground-floor two-bedroom apartment to the market. Set within a highly sought-after, mature residential area, this property is flooded with natural light throughout. Combining contemporary living with an unbeatable location, it is perfect for first-time buyers, families, and investors seeking a premium asset."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "The accommodation opens with an own-door entrance offering maximum privacy and convenience, leading into a bright, light-filled living area featuring large floor-to-ceiling windows. The fully equipped kitchen features an electric hob, oven, extractor fan, washer/dryer, dishwasher, and full-size fridge-freezer.The rear hallway leads to two bedrooms: a large master bedroom with built-in floor-to-ceiling wardrobes, and a second small double bedroom also featuring built-in wardrobes and double patio doors opening directly onto a private, sunny south-facing rear garden with convenient pedestrian access. A modern family bathroom with a full-sized bath, overhead shower, and space for extra storage completes the layout. The property also benefits from a fully fitted alarm system and gas-fired central heating. \r\n\r\nPARKING: dedicated parking space is located right outside the apartment door."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Large Spacious Ground Floor Apartment with Own Entrance Door and Designated Parking\r\nIn Turn-key condition with a High Quality Finish throughout\r\nSpacious South Facing Garden with Pedestrian Access\r\nTwo Spacious Bedrooms with Built-in Storage\r\nFamily Bathroom with Full Size Bath"
      },
      {
